and bundled Azerbaijani hyphenation pattern data.

The principal runtime files are:

```text
tex/latex/azhyphen/azhyphen.sty
tex/latex/azhyphen/azhyphen.lua
tex/latex/azhyphen/azhyphen-version.tex
tex/latex/azhyphen/azhyphen.hyp.txt
tex/latex/azhyphen/azhyphen-xetex.tex
tex/latex/azhyphen/azhyphen.pat.txt
```

Generated files derived from the canonical pattern data are distributed as
part of this work. If a file carries a separate compatible copyright or
license notice, that notice applies to the affected file as stated there.
